# The idle gap is ten minutes, measured from when the last fact finished. Exactly ten minutes of
# quiet keeps the episode; one second more starts the next. A long run's quiet starts at its end.
+0:00 run app green
+10:00 run app green
+20:01 run app green 600s
+39:00 run app green
expect 1 green Working in app
expect 2 working Working in app
